keywords:
  - idempotent total graph
  - zero-divisor graph
  - commutative ring
  - Chinese Remainder Theorem
  - NetworkX
abstract: >-
  Python code for constructing, drawing and analysing the idempotent total
  graph of the ring Z_n, whose vertices are the non-zero zero-divisors and in
  which two vertices are adjacent when their sum is an idempotent. The code
  verifies the degree formula, the degree bounds and the edge-count formula of
  the accompanying paper for all n up to a given bound.
